# List registered logger names in the serving node's logger-name hierarchy.
# The base is the node's actual logger name, including its namespace and remapping.
# No request fields are needed.
---
# Sorted, unique registered names in this process that equal the base or are its
# dot-separated descendants. This is a name filter, not a record of node ownership.
# Names remain listed after logger destruction, until logging is shut down.
# Configuring a severity or emitting a log alone does not register a name.
string[] names
